WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.500
Ryu falls after heavy Adamant Flame’s forward-punch follow-up.

2
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:00.850
Akuma dashes toward the falling opponent.

3
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.300
A second dash closes the remaining distance.

4
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.950
Akuma adds a short forward walk before throwing.

5
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:03.450
The forward throw leaves Ryu on the floor.
